pps/2419720/extras/3859c8ed3bc7fefd448062d5afc45f84.mp4?t=1749217476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The full version of the game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >56 skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 artifacts (after consumption, gives the character a mutation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 boosters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >61 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 difficulty levels in Arenas game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game modes: Arenas and Campaign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419720/extras/717dfb364fcb998a890361493272f955.poster.avif?t=1749217476\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419720/extras/717dfb364fcb998a890361493272f955.webm?t=1749217476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419720/extras/717dfb364fcb998a890361493272f955.mp4?t=1749217476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wish you adrenaline-filled gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the community and write to the discord and community hub!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419720/extras/4e30efd77475788c84119014d9fbd8cc.avif?t=1749217476\" /></span></p>",
